
### Get all experiments
GET http://localhost:8080/api/experiments

### Create experiment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/experiments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test CRUD",
  "description": "Testing all API operations"
}

### Get one experiment - replace ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/experiments/6ace9a17657b11922bae1bda

### Update experiment - replace ID
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/experiments/6ace9a17657b11922bae1bda
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated experiment",
  "description": "Updated description"
}

### Delete experiment - replace ID
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/experiments/6ace9a17657b11922bae1bda
